1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,906
Festival day at the second
Chai Corner, and a huge rush.

2
00:00:04,206 --> 00:00:06,295
But nobody knows who should do what.

3
00:00:06,845 --> 00:00:09,635
The new helper waits for
orders that never come.

4
00:00:09,935 --> 00:00:13,313
The chai is ready, but the
samosas are ten minutes late.

5
00:00:13,613 --> 00:00:16,924
Cold chai, no snacks, and
the customers walk away.

6
00:00:17,574 --> 00:00:19,985
Everyone works hard, but not together.

7
00:00:19,985 --> 00:00:22,350
The team needs direction, and timing.

8
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,499
So, what is directing?

9
00:00:24,799 --> 00:00:28,892
Directing means guiding, instructing,
and motivating people to reach a

10
00:00:28,892 --> 00:00:29,792
goal.

11
00:00:30,019 --> 00:00:31,546
Planning sets the goal.

12
00:00:31,546 --> 00:00:33,929
Directing gets people moving toward it.

13
00:00:34,579 --> 00:00:36,464
Directing has four elements.

14
00:00:36,864 --> 00:00:37,764
One.

15
00:00:37,363 --> 00:00:38,263
Supervision.

16
00:00:38,254 --> 00:00:42,545
Ravi watches the new helper, and
shows her how to strain the tea.

17
00:00:42,895 --> 00:00:43,795
Two.

18
00:00:43,465 --> 00:00:44,426
Motivation.

19
00:00:44,426 --> 00:00:46,784
Giving people a reason to try.

20
00:00:46,784 --> 00:00:50,819
He praises good work, and
pays a bonus on busy days.

21
00:00:51,169 --> 00:00:52,069
Three.

22
00:00:51,777 --> 00:00:52,677
Leadership.

23
00:00:52,634 --> 00:00:54,218
Ravi sets the example.

24
00:00:54,218 --> 00:00:57,457
He comes in first, and
stays calm in the rush.

25
00:00:57,807 --> 00:00:58,707
And four.

26
00:00:58,658 --> 00:00:59,707
Communication.

27
00:00:59,707 --> 00:01:01,462
Clear talk, both ways.

28
00:01:01,462 --> 00:01:05,086
A short huddle before
opening, where anyone can ask.

29
00:01:05,736 --> 00:01:08,597
But guiding each person
is only half the job.

30
00:01:08,897 --> 00:01:10,593
So, what is coordinating?

31
00:01:10,893 --> 00:01:15,228
Coordinating means syncing everyone's
work, so they move together toward

32
00:01:15,228 --> 00:01:16,128
one goal.

33
00:01:16,655 --> 00:01:18,104
Think of an orchestra.

34
00:01:18,404 --> 00:01:20,019
Every musician plays well.

35
00:01:20,019 --> 00:01:22,238
But alone, they don't stay together.

36
00:01:22,538 --> 00:01:25,062
The conductor keeps them
all on the same beat.

37
00:01:25,712 --> 00:01:28,412
Ravi becomes the conductor of Chai Corner.

38
00:01:28,762 --> 00:01:30,670
The chai takes six minutes.

39
00:01:30,670 --> 00:01:32,217
The samosas take ten.

40
00:01:32,567 --> 00:01:36,918
So the samosas go into the fryer
four minutes before the chai starts.

41
00:01:37,268 --> 00:01:41,474
At minute ten, the chai is poured,
and the samosas are ready, together.

42
00:01:41,824 --> 00:01:45,594
And Meena clears the tables just
as the next group sits down.

43
00:01:46,244 --> 00:01:51,244
Harold Koontz and Cyril O'Donnell called
coordination the essence of management.

44
00:01:51,594 --> 00:01:53,262
It is not a separate step.

45
00:01:53,262 --> 00:01:56,704
It runs through every function,
from planning to controlling.

46
00:01:57,304 --> 00:01:59,562
So, directing moves each person.

47
00:01:59,562 --> 00:02:01,981
Coordinating makes them move as one.

48
00:02:02,631 --> 00:02:03,622
Quick check.

49
00:02:03,622 --> 00:02:08,096
Ravi times the samosas to be ready
exactly when the chai is poured.

50
00:02:08,096 --> 00:02:09,199
What is this?

51
00:02:11,099 --> 00:02:11,999
Coordinating!

52
00:02:11,993 --> 00:02:15,484
It makes different jobs fit
together, at the right time.

53
00:02:16,084 --> 00:02:17,093
So, remember.

54
00:02:17,393 --> 00:02:21,103
Directing means guiding,
instructing, and motivating people.

55
00:02:21,453 --> 00:02:26,256
Its four elements are supervision,
motivation, leadership, and communication.

56
00:02:26,606 --> 00:02:28,848
Coordinating syncs everyone's work.

57
00:02:28,848 --> 00:02:31,110
It is the essence of management.

58
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:36,170
Next time, Ravi checks if the new
outlet is on track, with controlling.
